sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T1 as Tab 1
  participant T2 as Tab 2
  participant S as Server
  participant D as Postgres

  T1->>S: GET /settings/members
  S-->>T1: Acme members, rendered with Acme's organizationPublicId
  T2->>S: switch workspace to Globex
  S->>D: session.active_organization_id = Globex
  T1->>S: removeMember(Acme's organizationPublicId, memberPublicId)
  S->>D: active organization is Globex
  S-->>T1: tenant_changed, nothing checked or changed
  T1-->>T1: "You switched workspace in another tab", re-render as Globex
